  **Domestic Content Requirements (Total Removal):**\n    *   **v2.0:** Contained extensive sections (1.1 through 1.7) and three detailed tables (Crystalline Silicon, Thin-Film, and Concentrated PV) outlining designated activities and qualifying percentages for domestic content.\n    *   **v3.1.1:** All text and tables regarding Domestic Content Requirements have been **entirely removed**.\n\n### 5. Identical Sections (Summary)\n*   **Part 2, Section 1 (Term):** Identical.\n*   **Part 2, Section 11 (Governing Law):** Identical.\n*   **Part 2, Section 13 (LDC Failure to Pay):** Identical.\n*   **Appendix B (Calculation of Indexed Contract Price):** Identical.\n*   **Appendix D-1 & D-2 (Connection Schedules):** Identical.\n*   **Appendix E (LDC Supplier Schedule):** Substantially identical (minor punctuation/formatting changes in 3.1)."}, :duration-ms 7829, :event/tags #{[:tick #uuid "b1f8fb5b-567c-4b17-bb0c-e25a7cb9e659"] [:sheet #uuid "4d782c6b-5574-4298-b5b9-a4aa3cf20a28"] [:node #uuid "8b8a591d-be90-4552-966e-b421497f275c"]}, :event/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:01:11.653335-05:00", :usage {:prompt-tokens 25466, :completion-tokens 1271, :total-tokens 26737}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "8b8a591d-be90-4552-966e-b421497f275c", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-completed, :sheet-id #uuid "4d782c6b-5574-4298-b5b9-a4aa3cf20a28", :event/id #uuid "019e431d-90e5-7027-b920-748595621782"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YaTG3DkdBJnEOyDP3Od7HEPl6CYjD", :mulog/timestamp 1779242471655, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3YaTG3DkdBJnEOyDP3Od7HEPl6CYjD", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution :high}
