he application was first submitted.\n    *   **v3.1.1:** Added part (b) allowing OPA, in its \"sole and absolute discretion,\" to issue a written confirmation deeming a building an \"Existing Building\" even if it doesn’t meet the default criteria.\n*   **Domestic Content Requirements (Total Removal):**\n    *   **v2.0:** Contained extensive sections (1.1 through 1.7) and three detailed tables (Crystalline Silicon, Thin-Film, and Concentrated PV) outlining designated activities and qualifying percentages for domestic content.\n    *   **v3.1.1:** All text and tables regarding Domestic Content Requirements have been **entirely removed**.\n\n### 5. Identical Sections (Summary)\n*   **Part 2, Section 1 (Term):** Identical.\n*   **Part 2, Section 11 (Governing Law):** Identical.\n*   **Part 2, Section 13 (LDC Failure to Pay):** Identical.\n*   **Appendix B (Calculation of Indexed Contract Price):** Identical.\n*   **Appendix D-1 & D-2 (Connection Schedules):** Identical.\n*   **Appendix E (LDC Supplier Schedule):** Substantially identical (minor punctuation/formatting changes in 3.1)."}, :node-id #uuid "d4546a83-8074-426a-8d52-0b1af709067a", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-started, :sheet-id #uuid "4d782c6b-5574-4298-b5b9-a4aa3cf20a28", :event/id #uuid "019e431d-90ea-7022-a0ab-70ddae1aa962"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YaTH0d7saCKeD5gLdruhoKmz4BCp_", :mulog/timestamp 1779242471659, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3YaTH0d7saCKeD5gLdruhoKmz4BCp_", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution :high}
