s how parties interact, it is primarily a procedural clarification. Mandating specific forms for notices, terminations, and amendments ensures administrative consistency but does not change the underlying rights of the parties.\n*   **Addition of \"Website\" Definition (Appendix A):**\n    *   **Reason:** This is a clarification to ensure all parties know where to find the \"Prescribed Forms\" and program updates, reducing ambiguity regarding official communication channels.\n\n### **3. COSMETIC CHANGES (Formatting, Grammar, and Numbering)**\n*   **Section Renumbering (Section B and Section 4.4):**\n    *   **Reason:** Following the removal of Domestic Content clauses, the subsequent clauses were renumbered. This is a standard document maintenance task to ensure internal consistency and has no legal impact.\n*   **Minor Punctuation/Formatting in Appendix E (Section 3.1):**\n    *   **Reason:** These are \"substantially identical\" changes that do not alter the meaning or enforcement of the LDC Supplier Schedule."}, :duration-ms 4279, :event/tags #{[:tick #uuid "b1f8fb5b-567c-4b17-bb0c-e25a7cb9e659"] [:sheet #uuid "4d782c6b-5574-4298-b5b9-a4aa3cf20a28"] [:node #uuid "d4546a83-8074-426a-8d52-0b1af709067a"]}, :event/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:01:15.942212-05:00", :usage {:prompt-tokens 1402, :completion-tokens 618, :total-tokens 2020}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "d4546a83-8074-426a-8d52-0b1af709067a", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-completed, :sheet-id #uuid "4d782c6b-5574-4298-b5b9-a4aa3cf20a28", :event/id #uuid "019e431d-a1a6-705a-afb7-25cd607249f4"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YaiE_tTy03jzYl128xpkttRs3FWDx", :mulog/timestamp 1779242475944, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3YaiE_tTy03jzYl128xpkttRs3FWDx", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution :high}
